      "heading": "B — Audience, level and prerequisites: speed, curves, turning and following",
      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## B — Audience, level and prerequisites: speed, curves, turning and following\nAudience: first-time North Carolina applicants preparing for the regular Class C knowledge test, in English; the maximum speed table [A02] is core recall material.\nLevel: a mix of exact numbers (speed limits, stopping distance, following gap) and technique sequences (curves, lane changes) that suit ordered recall drills.\nPrerequisites: the school bus material in the previous section, since the bus speed limit reappears in the speed table, and basic vehicle control from the testing section.\nSensitivity: none beyond legal accuracy; speed limits are stated exactly as printed.\n",
